# sopllc has no parent dependencies

`sopllc/` is cloned and deployed by itself. Nothing in that directory may read, import, or assume files outside it.

- Env comes from `sopllc/.env.local` or the sopllc Vercel project. Do not load `site/.env.local` or any other parent path.
- Do not import from `site/`, `scripts/`, or other dbb packages into `sopllc/`.
- Handlers live in `sopllc/api/`. Shared server code lives in `sopllc/server/`.
- `DATABASE_URL` is the pooled Neon connection string. The real value stays in `.env.local` or Vercel, not in git.

```js
// bad — reaches into the parent repo
loadEnv(mode, new URL('../site', import.meta.url).pathname, '')

// good — sopllc root only
loadEnv(mode, fileURLToPath(new URL('.', import.meta.url)), '')
```
